w shows a 'drive' folder containing three subfolders: 'user1', 'user2', and=
 'user3'. A dashed arrow labeled 'expand' points to the right, indicating a=
n expansion operation. The right side displays the expanded view of the 'dr=
ive', revealing the contents of each user folder.  'user1' contains a subfo=
lder 'recipes' and a file 'chicken_soup.txt'. 'user2' contains files 'footb=
all.mov' and 'sports.txt'. Finally, 'user3' contains the file 'best_pic_eve=
